WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.810
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:16.470
Last time: labels must be right

3
00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:23.250
Chapter 4 · Data — The Food AI Eats

4
00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:34.210
AI eats food?! Let's find out.

5
00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:43.480
Meet Meera and her puppy, Bruno

6
00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:54.280
Dog Spotter learns from 500 photos of Bruno

7
00:00:54.280 --> 00:01:07.780
Big, white Moti → "Not a dog!"

8
00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:17.360
Why did the app get it wrong? Think!

9
00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:25.000
Hold that thought…

10
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:34.090
DATA = information AI learns from

11
00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:45.460
Data is the food AI eats

12
00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:54.690
Dataset = a big collection of data

13
00:01:54.690 --> 00:02:03.660
Pictures: cats, mangoes, buses

14
00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:09.540
Words: stories, messages, questions

15
00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:20.280
Sounds: voices, songs, barking

16
00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:34.490
Real shoes: not data. A photo of shoes: data!

17
00:02:34.490 --> 00:02:45.970
Only rice, every single day? Hmm…

18
00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:56.990
A thali: dal, sabzi, roti, curd, fruit

19
00:02:56.990 --> 00:03:07.320
Variety = many different kinds

20
00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:19.990
Only Bruno → it thinks dog = small & brown

21
00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:27.460
Moti didn't match anything it had seen

22
00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:38.680
Big · small · brown · white · spotty dogs

23
00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:51.060
Now it spots Moti! Variety works.

24
00:03:51.060 --> 00:04:13.920
Which dataset teaches "dog" best?

25
00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:25.720
C! Lots of photos AND lots of variety

26
00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:33.720
Some data should stay private

27
00:04:33.720 --> 00:04:41.370
Public: trees, animals, the Taj Mahal

28
00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:49.740
Private: address, phone number, family photos

29
00:04:49.740 --> 00:05:00.940
No collecting private data without permission!

30
00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:17.330
Public or private? Sort them!

31
00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:25.730
Tree, Taj Mahal: public. Address, phone: private

32
00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:29.630
Your turn: practice check

33
00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:43.300
200 photos of only parrots: enough? Why?

34
00:05:43.300 --> 00:06:03.780
No! It needs crows, sparrows, pigeons, peacocks…

35
00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:08.790
Data is the food AI eats

36
00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:12.030
Pictures, words & sounds are data

37
00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:16.590
Variety teaches AI better

38
00:06:16.590 --> 00:06:20.570
Some data should stay private

39
00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:28.700
Chapter 4 done!

40
00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:35.500
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
